# Khaleed, Desert Scimitar

> Khaleed is sold in the hero pool as an EXP fighter, but the version that actually wins games in 2026 is a roamer carrying Thunder Belt. The Desert Power passive plus a Thunder Belt proc is the single cleanest true-damage tick a non-jungler can produce, and his ultimate is the longest CC-immune forced engage in the roam pool.

