## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Thunder Control (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Oracle
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Radiant Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use against repeated magic poke, burn, or DPS that keeps hitting Khaleed while Quicksand Guard is channeling.; Athena's Shield over Antique Cuirass when Use when one burst mage decides the fight before Khaleed can spend the S2 heal.; Rapid Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy has low crowd control and Khaleed's main job is crossing river first for vision and Thunder Belt stacks.
- Total cost: 10680 gold

Default roam setup that turns Sand Walk into a Thunder Belt engage tool while keeping enough defense to survive after the first ult angle.

### Roam Rapid Vision (Roam)

- Items: Rapid Boots, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Radiant Armor, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Oracle
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Tough Boots over Rapid Boots when Use when chain crowd control makes Rapid Boots rotations less valuable than Fortitude's shorter lockout windows.; Antique Cuirass over Radiant Armor when Use against physical skill chains from fighters or assassins that can cancel Quicksand Guard before it restores enough HP.; Athena's Shield over Radiant Armor when Use against one-shot magic burst rather than repeated magic chip.
- Total cost: 10440 gold

Fast-map roam setup for games where Khaleed wins by arriving first, marking targets with Focusing Mark, and feeding allied damage through Encourage.

### EXP Sustain Bruiser (EXP)

- Items: Warrior Boots, War Axe, Thunder Belt, Oracle, Queen's Wings, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Thunder Belt, Oracle
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use against heavy magic crowd control where one failed channel removes Khaleed's sustain window.; Dominance Ice over Queen's Wings when Use when the enemy EXP or gold laner relies on healing, shields, or attack speed more than burst damage.; Antique Cuirass over Queen's Wings when Use when physical skill burst forces Khaleed to spend Quicksand Guard defensively every fight.; Malefic Roar over Immortality when Use only when ahead into armor-stacking frontliners and the team already has a safer primary engage.
- Total cost: 10870 gold

EXP lane setup for extended melee games where Khaleed needs War Axe pressure, Thunder Belt scaling, and enough sustain to hold side-lane tempo.

